### Fork: local-only, never publish ###
_UPLOAD_GUIDE.md

# Prebuilt jar lives in release/, NOT dist/, because the NetBeans block above
# already ignores /dist/ and would silently drop it from the commit.
#
# release/ is ~30MB and is committed on purpose so users can install without a
# toolchain. To ship it as a GitHub Release attachment instead, uncomment:
# release/

